	// because `Queries.isStdlibSourceFile` is a memo probe on a `FilePath` key — which clones and
	// lower-cases the path — and this compile has already classified every path once. It is
	// `livesUnderStdlibDirectory` and NOT `isStdlibSource` for the reason
	// `Parser.requireTypeNameNotCompilerOwned` states: a project rooted under `stdlib/` must still record its
	// own declarations, or the readiness probe would disagree with the loaded module.
