	// parse is a pure function of one file's tokens, so two files parsed independently would both hand out
	// counter slot 0 if the parser numbered into a shared table. The id in a `MaxonOp.covPoint` is therefore
	// FILE-LOCAL, `mergeArtifact` appends this array to `project.covPoints` and records where it landed
